; gh-ocannl-2082: a diagnostic probe of what macOS does to a Metal command buffer that never ends.
; Built only, never run by any alias: it stalls the GPU, so it runs by hand on a Mac with the GPU to
; itself. It links raw Metal, not OCANNL, so it reads no configuration.

(executable
 (name metal_hang_probe)
 (optional)
 (enabled_if
  (= %{system} macosx))
 (modules metal_hang_probe)
 (libraries metal ctypes unix sexplib0))
